<box.title>
Thank you for bearing with us!
</box.title>

<box.text>
Due to the implementation of a new error-catching system, Gwent has been hit by an avalanche of bugs!

So far, all the errors that have been caught were non-critical and, in the past, were simply logged silently in the background.
Attempts were made to patch them. I hope it will resolve the issue.

**As a gesture of compensation, the Gwent board will revert to the "Dear Van Gogh" theme until the end of this message.**
</box.text>


